> Should be extended further to also accept the bsd feature tag for FreeBSD, OpenBSD and NetBSD.

I think the solution is to add the following code to `OS_LinuxBSD::_check_internal_feature_support()`:

```cpp
#ifndef __linux__
    if (p_feature == "bsd") {
        return true;
    }
#endif
```

